        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: వడగళ్ళు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వడగళ్ళు — vaḍagaḷḷu — \"hailstones\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నిన్న వడగళ్ళ వాన పడింది. ninna vaḍagaḷḷa vāna paḍindi. Yesterday there was a hailstorm."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: వడగళ్ళు (vaḍagaḷḷu), hailstones; వడగళ్ళ వాన, a hailstorm. -గళ్ళు is the plural of కల్లు, a stone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వడగళ్ళు (vaḍagaḷḷu) is a Telugu compound: -గళ్ళు, \"stones\", from the native కల్లు, \"a stone\" (DEDR 1298), and వడ-, whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
